1	=== README.md
2	     1	# Harbor
3	     2	
4	     3	Ops dashboard for the services we run. It renders pages on the server from
5	     4	the snapshots the deploy pipeline writes to `data/` every minute; it never
6	     5	talks to the services itself.
7	     6	
8	     7	## Running
9	     8	
10	     9	    npm start        # http://localhost:3000
11	    10	    npm test
12	    11	
13	    12	No dependencies; Node 20 or later.
14	    13	
15	    14	## Pages
16	    15	
17	    16	Overview, Services, Incidents, On-call and Runbooks, one module each in
18	    17	`src/pages/`. `src/server.js` routes requests and wraps each page in
19	    18	`src/layout.js`; `public/app.css` holds the dashboard's styles.
